	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Preliminary underside interface for HiLetgo GY-SHT31-D, ASIN B07ZSZW92J. Carrier-side socket: Samtec SSW-104-01-T-S (1x4, 2.54mm pitch, THT, lead-free solderable). Pad pitch/drill/courtyard verified against Samtec's published SSW/SSQ mechanical drawing (2.54mm pitch; body length = 2.54mm x N + 0.51mm = 10.67mm for 4 positions, vs. 10.65mm drawn here; single-row body width = 2.41mm / .095in per Samtec's TH SSW drawing; 1.0mm drill matches KiCad's standard 2.54mm pin-socket land pattern) -- reused, not replaced. Mates with the breakout's own male header strip (supplied with the module), no separate header part selected.")
	(tags "SHT31 GY-SHT31-D 1x04 2.54mm preliminary Samtec SSW-104-01-T-S")
